  "qualifications": [
    "Standalone restorer requires only pinned compressed byte inputs, pathless raw identities and exact patch pins; comparison raw files are explicitly optional.",
    "The driver independently compares all existing168 target bytes; the default restorer checks complete raw base/target hashes.",
    "Callbacks/partial optional outputs are provisional until both final identities pass. Separate wrong-final-base and wrong-final-target controls refuse successful results after provisional chunks.",
    "Only the existing independently produced1504/168 pair was tested; no prospective audit or future capacity theorem is supplied.",
    "Fixed-family1MiB compressed-patch default is not a measured full-union budget; a future actual target needs newly approved pins/limits/storage.",
    "Portable distribution needs the exact preserved cdb source next to the new wrapper plus the already saved compressed base/patch; input paths can relocate while byte pins remain unchanged."
  ],
